      "id": "claim_1c1a5ca3d52e4aa88d961f0038efdab9",
      "statement": "The ingestion prompt lays out seven readings in order — split the agreement into business, domain and boilerplate clauses, find the contract, split the pre-contract context, pair request and confirmation, read a breach as a new pair, separate things, and extract computed values as calculator or checker things — plus hard constraints against inventing facts, missing provenance, rewriting legal clauses as obligations, more than two contract roles, and treating a moment as the confirmation of a period.",
      "evidence": [
